  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: 'The <b>Project window</b> is where you can find all the files used in your Unity project.


      Assets are the files that make up your project, such as <b>Prefab GameObjects</b>, <b>textures</b>, and <b>audio</b>.


      It works like a file explorer, and is organized in folders.'
